Computer Science Foundations — Licensing Notice
===============================================

This repository uses two licenses because educational material and software have different reuse needs.

1. Educational and documentation material — CC BY-SA 4.0
---------------------------------------------------------
Unless a file says otherwise, the following are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International license (CC BY-SA 4.0):

- lessons, exercises, projects, and research notes;
- curriculum, coverage, concept, example, reference, and track metadata;
- README files and documentation under docs/;
- Markdown templates intended to produce educational content;
- diagrams and other original educational media committed to this repository.

The full license text is in `LICENSES/CC-BY-SA-4.0.txt`.

When sharing or adapting this material, you must provide appropriate attribution, indicate changes, and distribute adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or a compatible license, subject to the license's terms.

